    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Minzī ga kweeja būsoso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūbawīla a ba Musa nū Alooni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya galī malange ayo SEEBA wagatūūlile kūlenganīla na shilagīlo shakwe: Bawīlage a Baisilaeli gīkī, bakūkwenhela ng'ombe yaza, ndogoosa ītī na shilingo nūūlū būka; nīyo ītaalī nūūlū kūtungīlījiwa ijoki lya kūlīmīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ombe yenīyo akwinhwa ngabīji Elieza, īīfunye hanze ya ng'hambī īkasīnzwe nang'hwe alīho hoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Elieza akūsola mininga gayo magehu ūbyūdabbya mo lwala lwakwe wagasaamula kū būtongi wiheema lya kwibilingīla, kūshisha ng'hangala mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho, ī ndogoosa yenīyo īkūpemva mu moto pyī ī yose nū wei alīho hoi, līkūpemva ī likūnza lyayo nī nyama, na a mininga gayo, pye nū būūshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ngabīji akūsola ntī gwa nkoola, na itambī lya hisopo, na būlūba waza; ūshiponeja a ha mimba gwa ng'ombe īyo īlīpemva mu moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū ngabījai akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, nū mīlī gwakwe ooga mu minzī. Ī likanza lyenīlo adūgije kūshoka ū kū ng'hambī; alīyo akūbalwa alī na būsoso kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū munhū ūyo alīyīpemba ī ndogoosa yenīyo, akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga nū mīlī mu minzī; nang'hwe akūbalwa kūbiza nsoso kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mabu ga ndogoosa yenīyo gakūyoolwa na munhū ūyo atī na būsoso, ūūkagaponya hanze ya ng'hambī, ūko mabū gakaponejiagwa. A Baisilaeli bakūgalang'hana chiza a mabu genayo, nguno gakūbiza ga kūyūsanjiwa mu minzī ayo gakatūmamīlagwa mu nīmo gwa kweeja būsoso wa banhū kūfuma mu shibi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū munhū ūyo alagayoole a mabu ga ndogoosa genayo akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe; nang'hwe akūbalwa kūbiza nsoso kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. Ī shenīshi shilī shilagīlo sha būja na būja kūlwa Baisilaeli bose; a baana byalwa na a bageni abo bakwikalaga hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ose ose ūyo ūskuumya mimba gwa munhū, akūbalwa kūbiza nsoso kūshisha ikanza lya shikū mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū wa gīko akūgatūmamīla a minzī genayo kwiyeeja, ū gwenūyo akūgwīta ha lūshikū lwa kadatū lwaho, nū lwa mpungatī, hūna ūbiza wela. Alīyo ūlū ūleka kwiyeeja ū mu lūshikū ū lwa kadatū nū lwa mpungatī, atīnga ū mu būsoso wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūkuumya mimba gwa munhū hūna ūleka kwiyeeja, akūbiza alīlīsosohaja ī lipandī lya kwikala lya ng'wa SEEBA. Ū ng'wenūyo akūkomanyiwa wīnjiwe ū mu Baisilaeli. Nguno nsoso, ataseeseebelilwe a minzī ga kūng'weeja; akwikala nabo ū būsoso wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūcha alī ng'wiheema, ī shilagīlo sha kūmutongeela shiishi: Ose ose ūyo wingīla ū ng'wiheema lyenīlo, akūbiza na būsoso kūshisha ikanza lya shikū mpungatī, pye nūūlū ūyo ūsangwa alīmo ū ng'wiheema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na būlī shiseme īsho shilīmo ū mu kaya ūlū shitī na ikundīkījo shikūbalwa kūbiza shisoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū alī kū malaale ū munhū akūbalwa kūbiza nsoso kūshisha ikanza lya shikū mpungatī, ūlū ūkuumya mimba gwa mhunhū, abize wabūlagagwa bo līlūshū, nūūlū wachaaga dūhū gīt'ūmo banhū bakachīlaga na kale; nūūlū ūkuumya iguha lya munhū achile, nūūlū ūkuumya shigila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūsosohala, solaga mabu mageehu a ga ndogoosa īyo īkapemva mu moto, ūgatūūle mu shiseme; hūna ūgītīīle minzī ga kwīnga mu mongo gwa kūhūūma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hama munhū ūyo atī na būsoso akūsola itambī lya hisopo, ūlīdabbya ū mu minzī genayo, hūna ūlīseeseebela ī liheema nī shiseme shaamo, pye na a banhū abo baalīmo ū lūshikū lwenūlo; nūūlū munhū wakuumyaga iguha lya munhū, nūūlū ūyo wakuumyaga shigila, nūūlū wankuumyaga munhū achile, ībize kūlwa kūbūlagwa na munhū ūngī, nūūlū wachaaga lūfu dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A a ha lūshikū lwa kadatū na lwa mpungatī, munhū ūyo atī na būsoso akūnseeseebela ūyo alī na būsoso; hama a ha lūshikū lwa mpungatī ūng'weeja. Ū munhū ūyo aleejiwa akūshifula ī shizwalo shakwe, hūna ooga mu minzī, hanuma ū lūshikū lwenūlo kwandīja ikanza lya mhīndī, ūbalwa kūbiza ng'wela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango kūlī munhū nsoso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alīyo ū munhū ūyo alī na būsoso ūlū ūleka ū kwiyeeja, akūkomanyiwa wīnjiwe ū mu banhū; nguno walīsosohajaga ī lipandī lyeela lya ng'wa SEEBA. Ataseeseebelilwe a minzī ga kweeja banhū, na lūūlū alī na būsoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shenīshi shilī shilagīlo sha būja na būja kūlwa nguno yabo. Ūyo alīnseeseebela minzī ng'wiye nang'hwe akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe; na būlī ng'wene ū wa kūgakuumya a minzī ga kweeja banhū akūbiza na būsoso kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na būlī shikolo īsho ūshikuumya munhū ūyo alī na būsoso, shikūbiza shisoso, na būlī ng'wene ūyo ūshikuumya ī shikolo shenīsho, nang'hwe akūbiza nsoso kūshisha līīmi kūlibīla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
